cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference ssERP, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "ssERP (Super Simple ERP)"
abstract: >-
  Open-source ERP, inventory and billing for shops that sell serialised goods (phones, CCTV, laptops, appliances).
  Tracks each unit by serial number or IMEI from the vendor's invoice to the customer and on into warranty and service.
  Built with Next.js, React, Drizzle ORM and PostgreSQL (Neon recommended).
authors:
